  "story": {
    "title": "Kichik hikoya",
    "text": "In the morning, my dad says, 'Do not go to work now.' I say, 'We can play in the afternoon.' My friend says, 'Do you have a book?' I give him a good book and say, 'Read it at home.' In the afternoon, we play with my friends, but it is cold. My dad says, 'You can go home now.' We say goodbye and go. At home, my dad reads a book and I write some words. We eat bread and drink water.",
    "optional": true
